{"parse": {"title": "Infinity Mansion", "pageid": 1577, "revid": 44358, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 242px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/58/Infinity_Castle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101201333\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Muzo&quot;I am an eternal creature infinitely close to perfection\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"242\" height=\"275\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Infinity Castle.png\" data-image-key=\"Infinity_Castle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/58/Infinity_Castle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/242?cb=20250101201333\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/58/Infinity_Castle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101201333\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Muzo&quot;I am an eternal creature infinitely close to perfection\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/58/Infinity_Castle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/242?cb=20250101201333\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"242\" height=\"275\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Infinity Castle.png\" data-image-key=\"Infinity_Castle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/58/Infinity_Castle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/242?cb=20250101201333\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Infinity_Castle.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><span style=\"font-size:200%;\">Muzo</span><br /><span style=\"color: #9e0000; font-size:125%;\"><i>\"I am an eternal creature infinitely close to perfection.\"</i></span></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Infinity Mansion</b>, introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_6_-_Jujutsu_Kaisen_Update_Part_1\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 6</a> as <b>Infinity Castle,</b> is a mode where the player is challenged with a series of seemingly infinite rooms. It's <b>EXTREMELY</b> tedious, but the rewards are worth your while!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>As of Update 18, for the first 63 rooms in the Mansion, the player is tasked with beating 3 acts of each story all the way up until Rain village gaining 150 gems for each floor.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>After the 57th room, the Mansion becomes unpredictable, however the next three floors after the 57th room will have higher HP before nerfing down at the 60th room onwards, so be careful!</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Starting Season 2, on Floors 100 and higher, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Affinities_/_Elements\" title=\"Damage Affinities / Elements\">resistances</a> show up, the further you go the stronger those values are.</li>\n<li>To access the Mansion, talk to the Muzo NPC by spawn. After heading inside, the Nakimo NPC will let you challenge the Mansion!</li>\n<li>From this season 9, you can change the mode to hard, it will clear 2 rooms, but the stage will be harder! However, after the 100th room, the mode is always set to hard, but you do not clear 2 rooms at once getting 300 gems instead of 150.</li></ul>\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0px 3px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: left; border: 0px; color: #FFFFFF;\">\n<caption style=\"border-collapse: separate; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 0px;\"><font size=\"4\">At the end of every season, players are awarded based on their performance in the Infinity Mansion. The <b>ranks</b> go as the following:</font>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(#FF6666,#FF0101) 10; background: #101010;\"><font size=\"5\">Tier</font>\n</th>\n<th style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(#FF6666,#FF0101) 10; background: #101010;\"><font size=\"5\">Title</font>\n</th>\n<th style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(#FF6666,#FF0101) 10; background: #101010;\"><font size=\"5\">Rewards</font>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">99.99% ~ 100%\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #EB0F0F 0%, #FB1D1D 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><font size=\"4\">Grandmaster</font></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><font size=\"2\">x5000 Gems, x50 Star Remnant, x1 Shiny Unit</font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">99.90% ~ 99.98%\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #96CDFF 30%, #FF6EEC 50%, #FFC4AB 90%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><font size=\"4\">Master</font></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><font size=\"2\">x3500 Gems, x45 Star Remnant, x1 Shiny Unit</font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">99.00% ~ 99.89%\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #FFC213 0%, #FFDC28 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><font size=\"4\">Expert</font></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">x2500 Gems, x35 Star Remnant\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">75.00% ~ 98.99%\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #5C01FD 0%, #7304F6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><font size=\"4\">Adept</font></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">x1000 Gems, x25 Star Remnant\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">50.00% ~ 74.99%\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #0C63CF 0%, #0F87E9 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><font size=\"4\">Disciple</font></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">x500 Gems, x15 Star Remnant\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">0.00% ~ 49.99%\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\"><font size=\"4\">Initiate</font>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; background: #101010;\">x250 Gems\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Season_1_(October_9th)\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Season 1 (October 9th)</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Season_2_(November_13th)\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Season 2 (November 13th)</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Season_3_(December_22nd)\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Season 3 (December 22nd)</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Season_4_(January_28th)\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\